---
globs:
  - "src/agent/verification/**"
  - "src/agentWork/executors/verificationExecutor.ts"
  - "src/agentWork/verificationThreadLedger.ts"
---

Verification run is read-only: no new findings, no code edits, no writable PR checkout. One verification stub per inline review thread (`<!-- pr-agent:verification-stub -->`), edited in place. Fixed and already-resolved quietly resolve; dismissed edits the stub (evidence + policy suggestion) then resolves. Stale superseded runs must not publish (ADR 0020–0023). Parse ledger JSON with `isJsonObject` in `src/util/jsonValue.ts` (`verificationThreadLedger.ts`). Do not treat JSON arrays as objects: `threads: [{ lastVerdict }]` must not become key `"0"`.
